  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop carrot and garlic. Trim green beans and cut into thirds. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice makrut lime leaves. TIP: Makrut lime leaves have a fibrous texture, so make sure you slice them very thinly!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e2cc8962e11c7a7b863f/step-0c41a71e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a deep frying pan or large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• SPICY! The curry paste is spicy, use less if you're sensitive to heat. Cook carrot, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add Thai green curry paste (see ingredients) and garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add coconut milk, water, lime leaves and vegetable stock powder. Stir well to combine, then bring to a simmer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e2cc8962e11c7a7b863f/step-3ed0a45e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add green beans and flat noodles to the soup. Cook until beans and noodles are tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Stir the Asian greens through, until wilted, 2-3 minutes. Add the soy sauce, then stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e2cc8962e11c7a7b863f/step-81c1e91b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long red chilli (if using).\n• Divide green curry veggie and noodle soup between bowls. Serve sprinkled with chilli and crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e2cc8962e11c7a7b863f/step-33a13d0c.jpg"
    }
  ]
